#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 							MT202EventMapping.scr
#
# Script to map and concatenate the repository values sent by the calling program (ORM)
# and form the MT202 swift message.
#
# The calling program will pass a repository BankRemittance which has values
# 'Y' or 'N'. Y --> Direct 202 and N --> Cover 202 message.
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Author : Rajashekar Kodancha
# Date   : 30-07-2002
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
